This repo is a DraconDex extension.

The app checks only that this file EXISTS at the repo root — its contents are
never parsed, fetched at install time, or shown to anyone. Keeping it means a
repo forked from this template already opts into the in-app
"install from @ZYDRAXYL" list without the author doing anything.

The manifest the app actually reads is dracondex-plugin.json.
